{"screen_name": "sleepyvearn", "file": "sleepyvearn-9d1435", "name": "時既に遅し", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891090260031143936/Ivg52AL0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1762745375151329280/1744533515/1500x500", "description": "|小号，会讲废话＆腿图\n|skeb：非常忙，高额设定中不用投递，不接受非公开/匿名委托，基本没在看可能会放置，有空的时候才会承认，非常抱歉！", "total_works": 69, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-02-16T11:44:17.167157+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-21T03:07:35.566503+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 20000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-16T11:44:17.167157+00:00"}, {"amount": 7000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-22T06:15:38.140289+00:00"}, {"amount": 20000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-23T08:05:37.819874+00:00"}, {"amount": 30000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-11T02:26:40.154636+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 30000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 7000, "max": 30000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/sleepyvearn", "name": "sleepyvearn"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@sleepyvearn/works/69", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e58784f9/uploads/origins/f8f2e749-3907-4199-8ee5-c6cbeb65df9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78f362596852ce86e75601b7fb1acd79", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e58784f9/uploads/origins/f8f2e749-3907-4199-8ee5-c6cbeb65df9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78f362596852ce86e75601b7fb1acd79, https://si.imgix.net/e58784f9/uploads/origins/f8f2e749-3907-4199-8ee5-c6cbeb65df9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f68a43b037f879ac89cf717d1d3507b0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e58784f9/uploads/origins/f8f2e749-3907-4199-8ee5-c6cbeb65df9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31c2855210020f800948aa23ed38ea1e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "大人好，尝试邀请您绘制我的OC\n\n塔维尔·沃特雷\n无性别\n出身邪教徒家族，由仪式而诞下的犹格索托斯之子，本来是一男一女的双胞胎，但为了获取犹格索托斯全部的力量，家族设计融合了双胞胎，得到了残缺但是保持了人型的他。有着恐怖的力量和超过人类的智慧，可以控制自己的肢体变成真正的怪物，人类含量很低。靠自己毁灭了家族之后独自在人类社会生活，经营一家古董店，回收和邪神力量有关联的物品。\n性格冷静克制，对大多数人漠不关心，也没有残害人类的兴趣。伪装的能力一流，演技也很好，为了得到自己想要的东西不择手段。\n掌握了很多危险的道具和法术\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cT-EVpD3GhrwXvmjOt9vfCs2bdZJVr1O", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sleepyvearn/works/68", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb98ca80/uploads/origins/ed1c7f9e-e8f6-4f75-81bf-0008aa46da9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65b043911bec1395d89d07b09990ccdb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb98ca80/uploads/origins/ed1c7f9e-e8f6-4f75-81bf-0008aa46da9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65b043911bec1395d89d07b09990ccdb, https://si.imgix.net/cb98ca80/uploads/origins/ed1c7f9e-e8f6-4f75-81bf-0008aa46da9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=075681da5e16926cf97e2acc2745cbc8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb98ca80/uploads/origins/ed1c7f9e-e8f6-4f75-81bf-0008aa46da9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8af5b4fae0e8aa2bafcf19c944cb93e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "老师好！！\n一直很喜欢老师的图带着OC试试投递！\n请随意选一位喜欢的画，可以随意简化！\n\n红毛：原设是骑士团团长，很自信热情又靠谱，喜欢有趣的东西。不用画帽子和武器~\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1d9HUBH3drazjzUrlNoM_JiFPUxwrvSdg?usp=drive_link\n\n不良：来自地球的不良少年，对生活提不起劲到处打工，喜欢玩游戏看漫画\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15FfsWFh-Ejn2Zi0I-4Bd-rtrTfGOVTRC?usp=drive_link\n\n非常感谢您！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sleepyvearn/works/67", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2fa88bf0/uploads/origins/29c2a84b-a4e3-415c-a640-ee5f1c7699f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e36f81becc3dae772598a786cf3967c0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2fa88bf0/uploads/origins/29c2a84b-a4e3-415c-a640-ee5f1c7699f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e36f81becc3dae772598a786cf3967c0, https://si.imgix.net/2fa88bf0/uploads/origins/29c2a84b-a4e3-415c-a640-ee5f1c7699f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe58a519dd10e7970b2502171076f5e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2fa88bf0/uploads/origins/29c2a84b-a4e3-415c-a640-ee5f1c7699f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64acd53afaf40ee7397654bf3f5dd7e4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "老师，您好！我一直都很喜欢您的作品，在这次免费期间，我想向您发送一份委托。请问您能画一下我的 OC（うちの子）吗？\n我准备了两种不同的概念，如果您无法画出方案 1，请随意选择并画出方案 2。\n请自由选择您想画的那个！\n\n1:博士\n黑发，有几缕白发\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1E0DdAaAxcQet7hhJu3NI1gDhJWZ5EMiF?usp=sharing\n\n2:黑头发蓝眼睛的年轻黑手党老大，参考文件夹中有其他 AU，请随意选择您喜欢的一款！\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pC6ff4AfXko-o810KlsPcCTajTj-PGbj?usp=sharing\n\n非常感谢您抽出时间阅读此文。如果您能接受我的请求，我将不胜感激。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Oa4yuf3sxIue_aI6OGenUU8FE8k1jkuo?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sleepyvearn/works/66", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e3bbd7d/uploads/origins/69f8d374-181a-4acc-aa58-4d1cf0c3b405?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=663e4b2fcda2761ed522b320a7cb8de2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e3bbd7d/uploads/origins/69f8d374-181a-4acc-aa58-4d1cf0c3b405?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=663e4b2fcda2761ed522b320a7cb8de2, https://si.imgix.net/0e3bbd7d/uploads/origins/69f8d374-181a-4acc-aa58-4d1cf0c3b405?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58f7f21931f722c74358d5e8321354e9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e3bbd7d/uploads/origins/69f8d374-181a-4acc-aa58-4d1cf0c3b405?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3eec88cfbcb18846c5b7bceb819c0e0d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "「VRChat」「アバター」「うちの子」「OC」\n女神我又来尝试了！不知道可不可以画这两只站一起或者是分开画🥺只画其中一个也可以！好想看到您画他们🥹\nhttps://www.mihuashi.com/character-card/c5bb12456c2c9f192cda45f8bf38559c92