自己的信念。他喜欢做好事，是个狗腿子。忠诚、直率、自信、固执、快乐、充满希望。紫色的头发，金黄色的眼睛。锋利的鲨鱼牙。身高 183 厘米。\n\n构图和诠释由您决定。请自由发挥！感谢您的考虑。\n\nhttps://peapup.notion.site/aizen-2438ee959002802dbc31c299f12b03db", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sleepyvearn/works/55", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c8a0084b/uploads/origins/e1f3f505-bcc4-42ea-a65c-a2f54c535582?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=764f4665623af4f2dd553540242154ec", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c8a0084b/uploads/origins/e1f3f505-bcc4-42ea-a65c-a2f54c535582?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=764f4665623af4f2dd553540242154ec, https://si.imgix.net/c8a0084b/uploads/origins/e1f3f505-bcc4-42ea-a65c-a2f54c535582?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=995b49bf1e56b2908ddbbf632af33bb8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c8a0084b/uploads/origins/e1f3f505-bcc4-42ea-a65c-a2f54c535582?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74c4c80b25bf71bbbf840e8aa89699be 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好，老师！我想为我的角色本瑟姆（Bentham）征集作品。\n\n他今年 22 岁，身高 179 厘米。本瑟姆是不死之身，能够治愈对他身体造成的任何伤害。他喜欢滑板和徒步旅行。\n\n他穿着宽松破旧的衣服，脖子以下都缠着纱布。他为人和善，喜欢逗人开心。\n\n他的衣服和姿势可以自由发挥。\n\n非常感谢您的考虑！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1boYLSkUTzp-XXKiwDXThzo2HGVK-2W7z?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sleepyvearn/works/54", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fc89a464/uploads/origins/e9c7a078-1965-481b-bde4-748e1f6c1889?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a72a4ff0223cd45cc5d75b74ac8d3be3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fc89a464/uploads/origins/e9c7a078-1965-481b-bde4-748e1f6c1889?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a72a4ff0223cd45cc5d75b74ac8d3be3, https://si.imgix.net/fc89a464/uploads/origins/e9c7a078-1965-481b-bde4-748e1f6c1889?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200